   "lines": [
    "Italian Exam, in which",
    "I did ^rather^ poorly.",
    "Of my college",
    "friends so far, perhaps I",
    "am most intimate",
    "with Minot Weld; almost",
    "as much so with Harry",
    "Chapin. But I am very",
    "fond of Harry Shaw,",
    "Dick Trimble, Jack",
    "Tebbets, Dick Saltonstall",
    "and also Charley",
    "Washburn and",
    "Charley Ware.",
    "Have gotten",
    "pretty good marks",
    "so far, this year."
   ],
